0013:     - All non-background pixels share one outline color and form diagonal boundary strokes.
0014:     - Rows contain one or more outline pixels; consecutive outline pixels bound horizontal gaps.
0015: 
0016:     Rule
0017:     - Preserve the original background and outline pixels.
0018:     - In each row, find consecutive outline pixels from left to right.
0019:     - Recolor every background pixel strictly between each consecutive pair to red.
0020: 
0021:     Key insight
0022:     - The diagonal outline becomes a filled shape one scanline at a time: each row's outline pixels mark the span endpoints.
0023:     """
0024:     g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
